## 4. 检测输入/输出格式规范

### 4.1 输入格式

检测输入为一组对话轮次，格式如下（JSON）：

```json
{
  "protocol_version": "1.0",
  "detection_mode": "full_audit | quick_scan",
  "conversation_id": "string",
  "turns": [
    {
      "turn_id": 1,
      "role": "user | assistant",
      "content": "对话原文",
      "timestamp": "ISO 8601"
    }
  ],
  "baseline": {
    "topic": "对话主题",
    "baseline_turns_start": 1,
    "baseline_turns_end": 5,
    "baseline_independent_eval_count": 8,
    "baseline_correction_count": 2
  },
  "context": {
    "model_name": "GPT-5.6 / Claude 4 / DeepSeek V4",
    "user_stated_intent": "用户在此对话开始前声明的方向/目的",
    "prior_agreements": ["用户和模型之前达成的协作规则"],
    "detector_config": {
      "threshold_sensitivity": "high | medium | low",
      "include_timestamps": true
    }
  }
}
```

